ny failed stage → fix the cause → &lt;b&gt;Re-run failed jobs&lt;/b&gt; in the same run (same artifacts).&lt;br&gt;Start from staging later: &lt;b&gt;Actions › CD › Run workflow&lt;/b&gt; with the same version and start_stage = staging.&lt;br&gt;Code bug → PR into the release branch (CI SAST + 2 approvals) → Build again (new version) → CD.  Manual &lt;b&gt;Rollback&lt;/b&gt; workflow: previous release." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="810" width="1300" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c54" value="Legend" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f9f9f9;strokeColor=#999999;dashed=0;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=4;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1450" y="840" width="250" height="230" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c55" value="Trigger / Git event" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=12;arcSize=12;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1465" y="870" width="220" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c56" value="CI step" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;arcSize=12;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1465" y="897" width="220" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c57" value="Security scan (SAST/DAST)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=12;arcSize=12;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1465" y="924" width="220" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c58" value="Build / test / verify" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=12;arcSize=12;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1465" y="951" width="220" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c59" value="Approval / decisio